===Etymology===
{{dercat|de|gem-pro|inh=1}}
From {{inh|de|gmh|vrëȥȥen}}, from {{inh|de|goh|frëȥȥan}}, {{m|goh|firëȥȥan}}, from {{inh|de|gmw-pro|*fraetan}}. Cognate with {{cog|nl|vreten}}, {{cog|en|fret}}, {{cog|got|𐍆𐍂𐌰𐌹𐍄𐌰𐌽}}, {{cog|sv|fräta}}.

===Pronunciation===
